# wear/man/kaftan_hang: the kaftan's long skirts parted over the linen under-robe, trimmed down both edges and along the
# hem, the shoes under it; the skirts sway by whole rows, spread over the striding legs and stream in the run
# GARB-M (P2b wave 2); fitted to the man (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
legend Z linen 4
body man
role garment kaftan
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10
# (z 10: over the shoe tips (legs/adult/loco/tips, z 9), so a foot lifted behind the hem stays under it)
sway 4
# (an elf stands a pixel taller in the legs: each view's stretch row doubles, so the hem still meets the shoes)

